+# Proposal
+
+## Why
+
+The booking desk of the Lakeside Windsurf School has no way to rent out boards and sails to students and
+visitors. The desk needs a rental module, starting with the basics: register equipment, quote a rental and
+book it without double-booking an item.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `createRentalService()`, exported from `src/index.ts`, returning an in-memory service with
+  `addEquipment`, `quote` and `book`.
+- Enforce the school's rules: integer euro cents, UTC ISO-8601 times, whole-day periods at midnight UTC,
+  no overlapping bookings of the same item.
+- Record the cancellation policy (no refund when cancelled less than 24 hours before the start, full
+  refund otherwise) in the spec so the later cancellation change builds on it.
+
+**In scope:** rentals of boards and sails (rental desk behavior), in-memory storage, quoting, booking.
+
+**Out of scope:** cancelling bookings and refunds (policy only recorded), persistence, customers, lessons,
+season (April to October) restrictions, discounts.
+
+No runtime dependency is introduced.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `equipment-rental`: registering rentable equipment, quoting and booking whole-day rental periods, and the
+  cancellation policy that applies to bookings.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+New code in `src/` (`src/index.ts`) and tests under `test/`. No existing code, README or package files
+change, and no dependency is added.
